{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254243/", "pk": 254243, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/", "pk": 60827, "shortname": "realfloridaadventures", "name": "Real Florida Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Kennedy Space Center with Airboat Adventure", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 8, "unicode": "Kennedy Space Center with Airboat Adventure", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 12.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 4250, "description": "#Kennedy Space Center Dine with an Astronaut\n\n##Duration\n\nApprox. 10.5 Hours\n\n## About This Tour\n\nWe know there is a LOT to fit into your Orlando vacation, which is why we’ve designed this classic combination that twins the essential excitement of the Kennedy Space Center with the thrills of an airboat ride and the chance to enjoy some of the real, natural Florida.\n\nIt may seem strange to combine the high-tech world of the KSC with the rural nature of airboating, but the fact is the Space Center is surrounded by conservation areas and wildlife refuges, so there is a strong link between the two, and you will get the full effect of ultra-modern and natural all on this one tour.\n\nIt all starts with a gentle drive out to Brevard County where the first part of your adventure awaits on the St. Johns River. Here, on the longest river in Florida, your airboat captain will showcase the natural splendors of Central Florida with an unforgettable ride on one of these unique, flat-bottomed craft that are powered by a giant propeller.\n\nSkimming along the river and its surrounding wetlands at up to 45mph, you will catch glimpses of alligators, turtles and other wildlife that make the river their home, including the state’s abundance of birdlife, from egrets and herons to eagles and ospreys.\n\nAfter your nature experience, it’s time to head to the home of One Small Step For Man and a complete immersion in the world of NASA and its astronauts. \n\nYou will have the rest of the day to explore the Visitor Center and soak up the vast array of exhibits and presentations that provide the full lowdown on the past, present and future of the space program as it gears up for a return to the moon, and on to Mars.\n\nBe sure to visit the superb Space Shuttle Atlantis exhibit for one of the most emotional tributes to the former earth orbiter, as well as the Shuttle Launch Experience and a host of hands-on opportunities.\n\n\n**Included**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tAn airboat ride on the St. Johns River and Lake Poinsett\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tGratuities\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n\n##Pickup Time and Schedule\n\n**Margaritaville Resort Orlando** at 7:15am\n*8000 Fins Up Cir, Kissimmee, FL 34747*\n\n**Golden Corral** at 7:30am\n**8707 Vineland Ave, Orlando, FL 32821**\n \n**Orlando Star Flyer at Icon Park** at 8am \n*8265 International Dr, Orlando, FL 32819*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "We look forward to seeing you soon!\n\n#Kennedy Space Center with Airboat Ride\n\n**Included**\n•\tAdmission into Kennedy Space Center Visitors complex \n•\tAn airboat ride on the St. Johns River and Lake Poinsett\n•\tRoundtrip Transportation from International Drive, Disney and Kissimmee areas\n•\tProfessional, Certified and Licensed Tour Guide\n\n**Not Included**\n•\tGratuities\n•\tDrinks\n•\tMeals\n\n##What to bring\nSunscreen, Sunglasses, Camera’s, Proof of Confirmation", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "All ages • Approx. 10.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254243/images/481065/", "pk": 481065, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/79o71uigTC25Eevxv1lt", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/79o71uigTC25Eevxv1lt", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254243/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/79o71uigTC25Eevxv1lt", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/79o71uigTC25Eevxv1lt", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254243/images/492188/", "pk": 492188, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/77SCm0lFT8iu8tUKJWQl", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/77SCm0lFT8iu8tUKJWQl", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/realfloridaadventures/items/254243/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/77SCm0lFT8iu8tUKJWQl", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/77SCm0lFT8iu